$ ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
$ PARAMETERS ARE TAKEN FROM
$
$ Thermodynamic description of the Ta-W-Zr system,
$ C.Guo, C.Li, S.Shang, Z.Du, Int. J. Mater. Res., 105 (2014) 1048-1056.
$
$ 95Gui: Ta-Zr Ref.[15] 
$ Phase diagram and thermochemical properties of the Zr-Ta system  
$   An assessment based on Gibbs energy modelling,
$ A.F.Guillerment, J. Alloys Compd. , 226(1995), 174-184.
$ 
$ ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
$ Comments
$ Lattice stability is taken from Unary 5.0.
$ 
$ The vertical section in Fig. 11 can not be reproduced. As other 
$ figures are OK, it is not clear the reasons why.
$                                                                         T.A.
$
$ ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 ELEMENT /-   ELECTRON_GAS              0.0000E+00  0.0000E+00  0.0000E+00!
 ELEMENT VA   VACUUM                    0.0000E+00  0.0000E+00  0.0000E+00!
 ELEMENT TA   BCC_A2                    1.8095E+02  5.6819E+03  4.1472E+01 !
 ELEMENT W    BCC_A2                    1.8385E+02  4.9700E+03  3.2620E+01 !
 ELEMENT ZR   HCP_A3                    9.1224E+01  5.5663E+03  3.9181E+01 !

$ ------------------------------------------------------------------------------
 TYPE_DEFINITION % SEQ *!
 DEFINE_SYSTEM_DEFAULT ELEMENT 2 !
 DEFAULT_COMMAND DEF_SYS_ELEMENT VA /- !

$ TA-W-ZR:LIQUID
PHASE LIQUID % 1 1.0 !
CONSTITUENT LIQUID : TA,W,ZR : !
PARAMETER G(LIQUID,TA;0) 10.0  +3.51634757E+04 -4.60238190E+01*T -1.99635084E-02*T**2 +1.83947499E-06*T**3 ; 6000 N !
PARAMETER G(LIQUID,W;0) 10.0  +5.21899263E+04 -4.65842932E+01*T -1.97281306E-02*T**2 +1.95556900E-06*T**3 ; 6000 N !
PARAMETER G(LIQUID,ZR;0) 10.0  +2.40531632E+04 -4.49336854E+01*T -2.33739406E-02*T**2 +2.20623418E-06*T**3 ; 6000 N !
PARAMETER G(LIQUID,TA,W;0) 10.0  -8.79110828E+03 +2.24812520E+00*T ; 6000 N !
PARAMETER G(LIQUID,TA,W;1) 10.0  -4.07131578E+03 -3.86452606E+00*T ; 6000 N !
PARAMETER G(LIQUID,TA,ZR;0) 10.0  +1.14540193E+04 +8.43807912E-01*T ; 6000 N !
PARAMETER G(LIQUID,TA,ZR;1) 10.0  -5.08835210E+03 -4.05822477E+00*T ; 6000 N !
PARAMETER G(LIQUID,W,ZR;0) 10.0  -4.09585347E+04 +3.00458253E+01*T ; 6000 N !
PARAMETER G(LIQUID,W,ZR;1) 10.0  -5.33933209E+03 +3.78303557E+00*T ; 6000 N !
PARAMETER G(LIQUID,W,ZR;2) 10.0  +2.08722690E+03 +9.80728653E+00*T ; 6000 N !
